## 🏆 LeetCode SQL Practice

**Problem:** Delete Duplicate Emails

- Language: MySQL
- Status: Accepted
- Test cases: 22/22 passed
- Runtime: 779 ms
- Beats: 85.49%

### SQL Solution

```sql
DELETE p1
FROM Person p1
JOIN Person p2
ON p1.email = p2.email
AND p1.id > p2.id;
```

**Concept learned:** Self JOIN and DELETE with JOIN to remove duplicate records while retaining the row with the smallest ID.

